# vhs assets/demo/demo.tape  → assets/demo/dscheck.gif
Output ../dscheck.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "dscheck check Button.tsx"
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Type "dscheck check Button.tsx --format agent | head -3"
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "# every finding names the exact token to use — agents fix themselves"
Sleep 3s
